{"title":"Baby Red Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 55 Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 36 times (1.4% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: breath: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"cone\",\n                rangeTiles: 4,\n                halfAngle: De\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 12e3,\n            damageMult: 1\n        }</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ember-gland\">Ember Gland</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>1,445</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=53\">Lv 53 <span>2,504</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=54\">Lv 54 <span>1,911</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=55\">Lv 55 <span>745</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=56\">Lv 56 <span>2,340</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>1,507</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s 